{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nirPZBSLg11795528869.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>消防(修訂)條例草案及定額罰款(消防)條例草案周五刊憲。</p><p></p><p>將修訂《消防條例》及3項附屬法例，涵蓋強化消防裝置及設備規管制度，引入消防裝置責任人制度，革新消防裝置承辦商註冊及紀律制度，優化消除火警危險流程，加強消防處的執法權力及打擊非法轉注燃油活動，並引入定額罰款制度等。</p><p></p><p>政府指下月二日向立法會提交兩項條例草案，進行首讀及二讀辯論，目標本屆政府任期內完成立法。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:03:53.278356+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T13:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T18:17:34.955582+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T14:57:15.818722+00:00","content_hash":"c6437e6392736681df7daab080ea4ba6f050c1893ff2d3a5ae2b643e8422e11a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:03:53.278356+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}